<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan bank gets 8.195 bln rupees in operation.</title>
<headline>Pakistan bank gets 8.195 bln rupees in operation.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said it had accepted 8.195 billion rupees in an open market operation in Short-Term Federal Bonds on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			Offered	 Accepted	Max cut-off</p>
<p>Outright sales    5,620	   5,395	   16.7490 pct</p>
<p>Five-month	  3,000	   2,800	   16.70 pct</p>
<p>Three-month	   200	     NIL	     NIL</p>
<p>One-month	    NIL		NIL	     NIL</p>
<p>Total(million rupees) 8,820	   8,195</p>
<p>($1=40.22 rupees) -- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
